e the same character\n   319→   - Narrator is identified as Nick Carraway (not \"Mrs. Sigourney Howard\")\n   320→\n   321→**This is the LAST attempt. If this fails, we move to the next text.**\n   322→\n   323→## Priority for Next Fix (Attempt 5)\n   324→\n   325→**CRITICAL - Must fix to have any hope of reaching 8.0:**\n   326→1. **CRITICAL #1:** Separate George Wilson from Myrtle Wilson (+5 points → Character Extraction: 7/10)\n   327→   - **Status:** Attempt 3 fix FAILED - merge still occurs\n   328→   - **Next step:** Investigate root cause with debug logging\n   329→2. **CRITICAL #3 (NEW):** Merge James Gatz with Gatsby (+3 points → Character Extraction: 10/10 if both fixed)\n   330→   - **Status:** New issue in attempt 3 - validation was too aggressive\n   331→   - **Next step:** Refine validation to allow same-person merges while blocking family member merges\n   332→3. **CRITICAL #2:** Fix narrator identification in plot summary (+3 points → Summaries: 9/10)\n   333→\n   334→**Estimated impact if all 3 critical issues fixed:**\n   335→- Characters: 2 → 10 (+2.00 overall)\n   336→- Summaries: 6 → 9 (+0.60 overall)\n   337→- **New estimated overall: 7.25/10** - still below threshold\n   338→\n   339→**HIGH priority fixes to cross 8.0:**\n   340→4. **HIGH #4:** Fix chapter title formatting (+2 points → Structure: 7/10 → +0.40 overall)\n   341→5. **HIGH #7:** Reduce false positives in pronunciation (+2 points → Pronunciation: 6/10 → +0.20 overall)\n   342→\n   343→**Estimated score after 5 fixes: 7.85/10** - very close!\n   344→\n   345→**Additional fixes to safely cross 8.0:**\n   346→6. **HIGH #8:** Add character names to pronunciation (+1 point → Pronunciation: 7/10 → +0.10 overall)\n   347→7. **MEDIUM #9:** Fix Jordan Baker relationship error (+1 point → Profiles: 7/10 → +0.15 overall)\n   348→\n   349→**Estimated final score: 8.10/10** - crossing threshold!\n   350→\n   351→**KEY INSIGHT:** Attempt 3 made the character extraction WORSE by introducing a new