d in pronunciation guide\\n   109→   - **Score impact:** -2 points (missing critical proper nouns)\\n   110→\\n   111→### MEDIUM\\n   112→\\n   113→9. **Jordan Baker profile contains factual error**\\n   114→   - Problem: Profile states \\\"She is involved in a relationship with Tom Buchanan\\\"\\n   115→   - Evidence: Jordan Baker is **not** in a relationship with Tom - she dates **Nick Carraway** (the narrator)\\n   116→   - Tom is married to Daisy; the profile appears to confuse the relationships\\n   117→   - Location: Character relationship extraction or profile generation\\n   118→   - Fix: Improve relationship extraction to correctly parse \\\"Jordan dates Nick\\\" vs \\\"Tom is married to Daisy\\\"\\n   119→   - **Score impact:** -1 point (significant factual error in a main character profile)\\n   120→\\n   121→10. **No relationships detected**\\n   122→    - Problem: \\\"Key Relationships\\\" section says \\\"No explicit relationships detected\\\"\\n   123→    - Evidence: Tom Buchanan and Daisy Buchanan are married (central to plot), Nick and Daisy are cousins, etc.\\n   124→    - Location: Relationship extraction in character profiling\\n   125→    - Fix: Improve relationship detection to capture family relationships (spouse, cousin, parent, sibling)\\n   126→    - **Score impact:** -1 point (reduces utility for narrator preparation)\\n   127→\\n   128→11. **Plot summary contains minor errors**\\n   129→    - Problem: Beyond the critical \\\"Mrs. Sigourney Howard\\\" error, there may be other factual issues\\n   130→    - Evidence: Haven't fully verified all plot details, but narrator error suggests prompt may be prone to hallucination\\n   131→    - Location: Summary generation\\n   132→    - Fix: Improve fact-checking or grounding in summaries\\n   133→    - **Score impact:** -1 point (in addition to critical #2)\\n   134→\\n   135→### LOW\\n   136→\\n   137→12. **Chapter 1 vs. Chapter 5 title inconsistency**\\n   138→   - Problem: \\\"Chapter 1\\\" and